> Customizing Mango - Decoration

Decoration settings are in ~/.config/mango/decoration.conf

### Animations

animations=1: enable window animations.
layer_animations=1: enable layer animations.
animation_type_open=zoom: zoom effect on window open.
animation_type_close=zoom: zoom effect on window close.
animation_fade_in/out=1: fade effects.

animation_duration_*: timing in ms:
move=400, open=500, tag=350, close=300, focus=600

animation_curve_*: cubic bezier curves for easing:
open/move/tag: 0.46,1.0,0.29,1
close: 0.08,0.92,0,1
focus: 0.46,1.0,0.29,1

### Blur

blur=1: enable background blur on windows.
blur_layer=0: disable blur on layer surfaces.
blur_optimized=0: standard blur quality.
blur_params_*:
num_passes=3, radius=3, noise=0.02
brightness=0.9, contrast=0.9, saturation=1.2

### Shadow Settings

shadows=1: enable window shadows.
layer_shadows=0: no layer shell shadows.
shadow_only_floating=1: only floating windows get shadows.
shadows_size=10, shadows_blur=15
shadowscolor=0x1a1a1a99 (RGBA hex)

### Window Opacity

focused_opacity=0.9: active window opacity.
unfocused_opacity=0.8: inactive window opacity.

### Borders

border_radius=10: corner rounding in pixels.
no_radius_when_single=0: keep radius even with one window.
borderpx=2: border width in pixels.
bordercolor=0x88aaad82: unfocused border color.
focuscolor=0x33ccffee: focused border color.
rootcolor=0x1f232bff: root window background color.

### Tab Bar Decoration

tab_bar_decorate_border_width=2
tab_bar_decorate_corner_radius=10
tab_bar_decorate_padding_x/y=3
tab_bar_decorate_font_desc: font for tab labels.

### Jump Label Decoration

jump_label_decorate_border_width=2
jump_label_decorate_corner_radius=10
jump_label_decorate_padding_x/y=6
jump_label_decorate_font_desc: font for jump labels (20pt).
